<p>Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)<br> zakhme jigar ko apne..(2)<br> akbar chupa rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>1. Bole hawa se akbar, kuch khaak hi udaa de<br> seena ghame sina ke, lillah tu chupa de<br> hum zakhm kha chuke hai, wo zakhm kha rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>2. Kuch der neend karlo, jaage ho raat bhar ke<br> kuch kaam hai phuphi ke, kuch shaam ke safar ke<br> hum raasto ke kaante, baba hata rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>3. Aana hai gar zaroori, is dasht e be amaa'n mein<br> is abr e teero khanjar, is barish e sina mein<br> abid ko bhej dijiye, kyu aap aa rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>4. Barchi ka phal hamare, seene mein kab hai utra<br> yaad aagayi thi sughra, seene mein dard uttha<br> seene pe haath rakhke, yaadein bhula rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>5. Sheh ne pa-e tasalli, akbar ko ye sadaa di<br> aye mere laal tumko, ab tak khabar na pohchi<br> sughra ka khat hai aaya, hum dene aa rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>6. Akhir wo waqt aaya, shabbir ladkhadaye<br> ghutno ke bal wo chalke, laashe pisar pe aaye<br> bole ae laal uth jaa, hum khat suna rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>7. Khat kya sunate maula, aansu bahake bole<br> wo kaise khat sunega, jo aankh tak na khole<br> hum aansuo se sughra, khat ko mita rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>8. Barchi jigar se khaichi, ubla lahu ka dhara<br> akbar tadap ke bole, ruk jaaiye khudara<br> sughra se kya hai kehna, hum wo bata rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
<p>9. Laashe pisar pe maula, ghash khake gir chuke the<br> maqtal mein gunjte the, saidaniyo ke nauhe<br> rehan aur raza jo, dohraye jaa rahe hai<br> Jis dum suna ke baba, maqtal mein aa rahe hai..(2)</p> 
